lisa-design:
- ci.yml leaves `images` unset: the v1.9.0 default `[{}]` (repo name `ui`, Dockerfile, context .) matches release.yml's `[{"name": "ui", "dockerfile": "Dockerfile"}]`, so CI scans the released image.
- AGENTS.md's CI bullet names the new non-gating image check so the "one check to require" guidance stays accurate.
